# label: alg:ch55-macro
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch55.tex:87
# caption: Expand a counted assembly macro with a private label.

REQUIRE valid register r, positive count n, shared fresh-name state
ENSURE one self-contained countdown sequence with no reused private label
label <- FreshName(countdown)
emit initialization of r to n
emit the private label definition
emit subtraction of one from r
emit a conditional branch back to label while the result is nonzero

